          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(v) When we heat camphor in one corner of a room, the fragrance reaches all corners of the room."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.123,
            0.882,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(vi) On heating, we are adding energy to the camphor, and the energy is released as a smell."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
